== Description ==

The '''Carpentry Workbench''' produces wooden weapons, bows, arrows, and plank-based building pieces. It defines 44 raw recipe entries (44 unique after consolidating shape variants), producing outputs including [[Bladed Pole]], [[Log Door Frame]], [[Log Fence]], [[Log Floor]], [[Log Gate]], [[Log Ladder]], [[Log Pillar]], [[Log Platform]], plus 34 more.

== Technical ==

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.CarpentryWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Carpentry</code>.

